          In This Guide
        </h2>
        <nav class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2">
          <a href="#why-paint" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">1. What Basement Floor Paint Actually Does</a>
          <a href="#paint-vs-sealer-vs-epoxy" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">2. Paint vs. Sealer vs. Epoxy: Which Do You Need?</a>
          <a href="#top-picks" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">3. Our 6 Top Picks Reviewed</a>
          <a href="#how-to-apply" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">4. How to Apply Basement Floor Paint</a>
          <a href="#moisture-check" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">5. Is Your Moisture Problem Too Severe for Paint?</a>
          <a href="#mistakes" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">6. Common Mistakes That Cause Peeling</a>
          <a href="#faq" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">7. FAQ</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </div>

